.TH SIMRV-TOOLS 1 "November 2026" "SimRV 3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
simrv-tools \- host-side helpers for SimRV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B simrv-tools
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B simrv-tools
collects host-side file generators and validators separately from the simulator runtime.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B scaffold cpu [PRESET] [FILE]
Write a CPU model configuration from a preset. Omit FILE or use \fB-\fR to write to standard output.
.TP
.B scaffold device NAME [DIR|FILE]
Generate an editable external MMIO device plugin project.
.TP
.B scaffold device --from-dtb DTB [DIR]
Choose an MMIO node from a compiled device tree and seed the plugin source and platform config with its compatible string, address range, and simple IRQ.
.TP
.B scaffold cfu NAME [DIR|FILE]
Generate a starter custom function unit plugin project.
.TP
.B mission check FILE
Validate and preview a classroom mission file.
.TP
.B mission create FILE
Create a starter classroom mission file.
.TP
.B disk create FILE --kernel EFI [--rootfs IMAGE] [--size-mb MiB]
Create an unprivileged GPT/FAT32 UEFI disk image.
.TP
.B completion [bash|zsh|fish]
Write a shell completion script for the SimRV runtime command.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR simrv (1),
.BR simrv-config-wizard (1),
.BR simrv-benchmark (1)
